[{"comment_id": "7663115208822965029", "create_time": 1784208047, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7662349906408983843", "content": "我从小就知道木屐是中国的，因为我们农村几乎家家户户都有", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "200", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAPH6Q7T3ThSYlSPPH8Hmgi3RHwdOfpo52E2n0Ra5ZPWg", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAPH6Q7T3ThSYlSPPH8Hmgi3RHwdOfpo52E2n0Ra5ZPWg", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "14784083", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "一颗果树", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c000-ce_oEoCEGWAADEAVwAAe2kEfFj1oEeXwIhM9thujA.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "1", "last_modify_ts": 1794419684246}, {"comment_id": "7662541650640372521", "create_time": 1784074509, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7662349906408983843", "content": "顺便科普一下：日本木屐和中国木屐是有区别的哦\n中国木屐前齿更靠前，也更方便走路，然后前面‘人’字部分有很明显的左右脚区分，日本的是中间开洞[贴贴]", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": true, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "1884", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAzZd_QVlREGynKk20QmbiTv7aoCDTkbkksCdqI-ODPOw", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAzZd_QVlREGynKk20QmbiTv7aoCDTkbkksCdqI-ODPOw", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "193116829", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "阿也📷", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813_oIMY7R04VEGABABxjEsFUDfEIfDARoAZKAfA8R.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "47", "last_modify_ts": 1794419684246}, {"comment_id": "7667271993875612473", "create_time": 1785175876, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7662349906408983843", "content": "木屐是中国的，抹茶是中国的，日本用来吃寿司的盘子其实原型是坐凳，他们跪坐纯用腿发力，而我们是有一个小凳子垫着，所以他们的腿变形，这些咋能不知道呢，很多影视剧也有啊", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "271", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAA-vFz_Bwm_A5wElExALJzBN0cVogzGGIcb0BxYdyfewyj1AAA86DcVR1mFAYHa4ba", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAA-vFz_Bwm_A5wElExALJzBN0cVogzGGIcb0BxYdyfewyj1AAA86DcVR1mFAYHa4ba", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "43195997884", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "渡鸦Yu", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_bb743a0d0bfc4ec178b3d6efb47df922.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "6", "last_modify_ts": 1794419684246}, {"comment_id": "7662374893971751715", "create_time": 1784035681, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7662349906408983843", "content": "应怜屐齿印苍苔，小扣柴扉久不开", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": true, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "559", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAA99VEdXkv-LESZ33vKbn0roAgiWqpGQW4e6W6ULNUGS4", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAA99VEdXkv-LESZ33vKbn0roAgiWqpGQW4e6W6ULNUGS4", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "36187998361", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "温岚", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813_oIJCqAI1VADqggAjEMDACHX0CDFW99REwAEffA.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "4", "last_modify_ts": 1794419684246}, {"comment_id": "7663068141816267535", "create_time": 1784197090, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7662349906408983843", "content": "这个木屐当时语文老师讲过，古人爬山会穿这个木屐，因为普通的靴子太笨重，这个木屐前后齿都可以拆卸，上山拆前面的（变成像高跟鞋那样的），下山拆后面的（也就是前面垫高），这样始终让自己如履平地", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": true, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "853", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAWmaSA6wbzA4YaSL4Z4VOmmfQJgNBjnrWZse-2xy7J9GSGJtMlR3KgZLRIU98MU0V", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAWmaSA6wbzA4YaSL4Z4VOmmfQJgNBjnrWZse-2xy7J9GSGJtMlR3KgZLRIU98MU0V", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "61436250691", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "Yuuu0517", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_85dfa93e3241354d3f0c91fbaf92b915.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "11", "last_modify_ts": 1794419684246}, {"comment_id": "7662384717950403364", "create_time": 1784037968, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7662349906408983843", "content": "谁懂，电影既视感", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "49", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAT_EooU_Co4u0d8HaWjwIQNcafrCjUcSi1QMxqJlb0VrN7NAxkIMz3wAj8iKc4O-2", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAT_EooU_Co4u0d8HaWjwIQNcafrCjUcSi1QMxqJlb0VrN7NAxkIMz3wAj8iKc4O-2", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "27286397670", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "佳", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813_oMCB0A8AiBqAIpigzNyAwnsfX9zeCJANtEAqmL.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "0", "last_modify_ts": 1794419684246}, {"comment_id": "7662369377643561786", "create_time": 1784034394, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7662349906408983843", "content": "本来之前我一直都不知道木屐是中国的，直到我在高一的时候学了一篇文言文，梦游天姥吟留别，好像是这首，老师对那个谢公屐的描述让我觉得和木屐很相像，后面专门去了解了一下就知道了", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "22", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAei3iZGxl83wN77MqLxab42Kfr10kfQxfkkh6VCx-bzw_B_Qr4d2rCWzo4Tso5uvw", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAei3iZGxl83wN77MqLxab42Kfr10kfQxfkkh6VCx-bzw_B_Qr4d2rCWzo4Tso5uvw", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "24137048412", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "瓜子皮", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c000-ce_oQEAIndfVnhE8rA96VIpIAFZfAtDYAwEAF9phC.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "0", "last_modify_ts": 1794419684246}, {"comment_id": "7668149702403162929", "create_time": 1785380231, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7662349906408983843", "content": "相传为春秋越国西施入吴后所演。吴王夫差为放大其舞姿韵律，在姑苏宫（馆娃宫）修筑“响屐廊”：地面铺木板，下埋空陶瓮作共鸣箱；舞者穿空心木屐、裙系铜铃，踏地时“咚—叮”交织，形成独特的踏响与铃音层次。相关记载见于《越绝书》《吴越春秋》（东汉成书），正史《史记》未载西施详传，其故事多属后世文学演绎。", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "48", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAyr1Q1yeRnotBsEXxZD1JFOX2paPTVzuxczJoj6CHw2Q", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAyr1Q1yeRnotBsEXxZD1JFOX2paPTVzuxczJoj6CHw2Q", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "dyi9zbbzow4q", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "望桢", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c000-ce_oYEEemD71EoAAAEywCIiuBGiIKBACNAwxwfW2p.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "0", "last_modify_ts": 1794419684246}, {"comment_id": "7663733397335933754", "create_time": 1784351980, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7662349906408983843", "content": "我现在就还在穿，这双都穿十几年了都不坏，穿着频率不高，都洗完澡拖鞋湿了才换木屐穿，也会穿着上下楼，出门走半个多小时也不见磨脚，甚至下雨也能穿，一开始是皮面，皮掉完了就成这布面了", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "95", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAApcFlm76rO6yu4QdvXRcFmo88jZFc6xly3hgPNxQaQ24", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAApcFlm76rO6yu4QdvXRcFmo88jZFc6xly3hgPNxQaQ24", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "ilianji", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "宇宙巡警", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813_oEyAAIzIngxzFCDRgoCF6NhvfAAeAAELDsi7AE.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "2", "last_modify_ts": 1794419684246}, {"comment_id": "7664767439516009275", "create_time": 1784592738, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7662349906408983843", "content": "刚刚正在背梦游天姥吟留别[杀马特][杀马特][杀马特][杀马特]正好对应脚着谢公屐", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "76", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAbICrlRWraHwx9dZFodfQHDvm5IrLTxcLJoOxo2GFlzHhsH_7tgaI4nyLnAIpwU05", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAbICrlRWraHwx9dZFodfQHDvm5IrLTxcLJoOxo2GFlzHhsH_7tgaI4nyLnAIpwU05", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "yhdr3201", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "是笙屿a", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c000-ce_o0A0v18uDQHWcWr6AVFAoQ93cCfuqAEIEewTA6.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "0", "last_modify_ts": 1794419684246}, {"comment_id": "7662394899836961578", "create_time": 1784040338, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7662349906408983843", "content": "木屐是中国的，《梦游天姥吟留别》中记述：“脚著谢公屐”。日韩，包括东南亚的越南在古时候都是我们的藩属国。所以我们的文化传过去，被他们吸收很正常。各位一定要保持文化自信。并非是我们的东西到他们那里就是他们的了", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "38", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAaj5NVLoRmCD2Cj-B3_lARqBQQOoDBatZT33bTnPBCyhO-W0xcBOqsgKeP2vjlrN0", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAaj5NVLoRmCD2Cj-B3_lARqBQQOoDBatZT33bTnPBCyhO-W0xcBOqsgKeP2vjlrN0", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "dy27724rwx", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "风恋窗台暖", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c001_owEOaIJQGfB8IEjDAIewAjAA5LvgAVBBfUU7t4.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "0", "last_modify_ts": 1794419684246}, {"comment_id": "7664987014383534888", "create_time": 1784643862, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7662349906408983843", "content": "我记得《梦游天姥吟留别》里有一句：“脚著谢公屐，身登青云梯”里的谢公屐，也是中国古代木屐的一种，这种木屐是用来登山的", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "12", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAY1BfDFwE2GPKby8UAsg6PCV-Xbcn4aOflNHSZpmF40Crn6BGbHa9LIsLv5D6ProP", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAY1BfDFwE2GPKby8UAsg6PCV-Xbcn4aOflNHSZpmF40Crn6BGbHa9LIsLv5D6ProP", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "gwybyyxf", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "港湾☁🧊", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c001_o0CiJmD5EH1AD0QCIANBfAwe3JAiAAEgA0S1IX.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "0", "last_modify_ts": 1794419684246}, {"comment_id": "7666088841429713670", "create_time": 1784900400, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7662349906408983843", "content": "很多时候后代的中国人不知道日本很多东西是我们中国的，看到那些属于我们的文明因为被日本学习和带走，在他们日本发扬光大后，竟然真误以为这是日本的代表形象。[笑哭]这个视频很有意义，它在传播，在引导。告诉那些不懂历史愚昧无知的后人，这是我们的文明[比心]", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "8", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAednZbMZD4ynK5VngTAP2ay0uKAnbfgYfbieYI9Jb5TS5p085yfdsAGsdiQmb7Zdt", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAednZbMZD4ynK5VngTAP2ay0