2349906408983843", "content": "当初汉服也是这样慢慢走过来的，被认错民族，被当成小日子服饰🌚🌚当街让一个人把衣服脱了烧毁，这事当时闹挺大的，早年受委屈的人很多，不仅同龄人不理解老师不理解，就连家长也不理解，不过这木屐比汉服难推广多，至今也有很多人一致觉得这种木屐是日本的[噢买尬]以前我说木屐中国古代就有，没人信，我想买要么没货要么标签不是中国的🌚🌚", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "143", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAA7tSGprZk9OXMbphHQfjcfaIZoqs4m6QajTC-sKut2b8", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAA7tSGprZk9OXMbphHQfjcfaIZoqs4m6QajTC-sKut2b8", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "195765400", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "bz清风（社畜版）", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c000-ce_oo9eAAOE9etfOACEswArSIAjEA8pyrDPAEAEFE.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "5", "last_modify_ts": 1794419684246}, {"comment_id": "7662408932879631141", "create_time": 1784043606, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7662349906408983843", "content": "木屐本就源于中国吧，李白的梦游天姥吟留别里有一句“脚着谢公屐”，就是一种适用于爬山，前后可拆卸组装的木屐", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "28", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAN8iGmucYD81wm5N7qNAJWDF0CBLIy8V-0wJZ8unQzI0", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAN8iGmucYD81wm5N7qNAJWDF0CBLIy8V-0wJZ8unQzI0", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "liorLV3721", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "liorLV", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c000-ce_okgfpfLQA57cAQTINEWTASGMgo8rAJTX8pvBew.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "0", "last_modify_ts": 1794419684246}, {"comment_id": "7662372039613137713", "create_time": 1784035015, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7662349906408983843", "content": "高中学过李白的梦游天姥吟留别，其中“脚著谢公屐”的谢公屐就是木屐，但是一想到木屐就在脑海里跳出日本，印象太深刻了，这个视频让我彻底改变了自己的知识构架，木屐就是中国的", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "161", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAM7mcGAV_unQS2U6inSQSwK4Wm5tcQFjW8-N74ynpT-92aVlg3Bvx0IYV_0i-Z79A", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAM7mcGAV_unQS2U6inSQSw